---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const pageTitle = "Ladislav's gallery";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <main class="main-container">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <h2>Why I paint?</h2>
      <p>
        Painting, for me, is the act of creating beauty with my hands — a quiet conversation between myself and the
        person who will one day see the work. It’s an attempt to understand what beauty means to both of us. Painting is
        unpredictable. I can never fully control the outcome, but I can begin with intention and trust the process as it
        unfolds. Every piece starts with an idea — something I hope will resonate with you and make you feel something
        genuine. As I paint, I challenge myself to go further than before, to make the next brushstroke more honest,
        more alive. If a work feels merely “good,” I let it go and begin again.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
